   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Order health check (hourly)\nRead only. Flags orders on integrated channels (Shopify, Amazon, Faire, TikTok) older than `graceMinutes` that are draft / quotation / failed, confirmed with no shipment, or carry an open exception. Emails only NEW problems (static data remembers what was sent).\n\nBuilt by Claude for Ben 23-Oct-26. Starts on SANDBOX. To go live: Settings tenant/baseUrl = PROD and switch the 3 read nodes to the Fulfil PROD credential.",
    "width": 520,
    "height": 300
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "03fbd56d-d392-51e1-8820-5847966ca3ba",
